howtoplay.title=§l§8Server Menu » §f⩆§8 How to Play?
howtoplay.text.1=§l§7Tutorial
howtoplay.text.2=§r§7• To level up, sell ores and blocks. Each level unlocks new pickaxes and ores. More in  Levels
howtoplay.text.3=• To unlock a pickaxe, also sell ores and blocks
howtoplay.text.4=• To sell ores or blocks, stand on a gold block
howtoplay.text.5=§l§cNote:§r§7 If you stole ore you can't mine, you can't sell it
howtoplay.text.6=§l§7Buying VIP
howtoplay.text.7=§r§7VIP is a privilege with new ores and a VIP shop
howtoplay.text.8=VIP costs 125K
howtoplay.text.9=Buy it in Menu »  Upgrades
howtoplay.text.10=§l§7Rebirth
howtoplay.text.11=§r§7Rebirth is replaying the map with a permanent haste effect
howtoplay.text.12=Rebirth unlocks after 16 
howtoplay.text.13=Upgrade in Menu »  Upgrades
howtoplay.text.14=§l§7 What do the icons on the left mean?
howtoplay.text.15=§r§7 - your Nickname (in-game name)
howtoplay.text.16= - your Money / Coins
