mapVersion.title=§l§8Server Menu »  Map Version
mapVersion.text.1=§l§7Here you'll find info about the latest map update
mapVersion.label=§2Map Version:
mapVersion.text.2=§lUpdate 0.2.0 from October 18, 2026§r
mapVersion.text.3=• All repeating command blocks have been replaced with functions: level-ups, timers, boosts and events
mapVersion.text.4=• Fixed level-ups: XP could be taken from another player standing on a gold block
mapVersion.text.5=• Promo codes can no longer be redeemed again after a Rebirth
mapVersion.text.6=• Registration and login updated:
mapVersion.text.7=- The login window no longer opens several times in a row
mapVersion.text.8=- Passwords are stored as a hash instead of plain text; minimum password length is 5 characters
mapVersion.text.9=- Chat, commands and the menu are unavailable until you log in
mapVersion.text.10=- Players with old accounts (Omlet Arcade) can set a new password, progress is kept
mapVersion.text.11=• PvP now works only in the arena: players can't damage each other at spawn or in other locations
mapVersion.text.12=• Scripts are faster; UI and translation errors have been fixed

